Mashup Library catalog

The recipes in this repository are instructions and links only. They contain no game files, mods,
loaders, tools, extracted assets or decompiled code, and none of those are distributed from here.

Every file a recipe points to belongs to its own creator and stays under that creator's licence and
terms. Following a link or installing a file from it is between the player and that creator.
Mods and loaders must always be downloaded from their official sources, never from copies of them.

Game names and trademarks belong to their owners. This catalog is not affiliated with any game
publisher or with the creators of the listed mashups, except where a creator has agreed to be
listed.

